<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty: Good of you to come. I knew you\nwould. I SAW it.\rIn Ecruteak, homies been respected\nforever.\rThey say a rainbow homie show itself to\na truly HARD Hustler.\rI been trainin’ in secret my whole\nlife. In the dark. With ghosts. It’s\flonely.\rNow I see what others can’t. I see\ndead homies. All day.\rI see the shadow of the one who gon’\nmake that rainbow homie show up.\rAnd that person is ME!\rYou finna help me level up!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty: I don’t think our potential is\nthat different... But you got somethin’\fmore. I didn’t see that comin’.\fAnd I see EVERYTHING.\rSo be it. This Chain yours.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Fog Chain from Morty!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty: With the Fog Chain,\nhomies up to Lv. 50, even traded\fones, listen to you.\rAnd your homies can use\nRide Da Wave.\rOne more thing...\nI want you to have this too.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty: It’s Magic 8-Ball. It hit\nand might drop Special Defense.\fUse it if you feel it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty: I get it now...\rThe person the Dancers was talkin’\nabout gotta be you... Not me. Again.\rYou strong enough to cross the sea.\nGo west, then south. Olivine City.\fI’ll be here. In the dark. Sulkin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! Future Kingpin!\nThe Hustlers here run Ghost homies.\rGhosts is like shadows. Phantoms.\nYou can’t punch a phantom.\fI tried. I punched a wall.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whew, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! You did GREAT!\nI was hidin’ in the corner screamin’\fthe whole time!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You here for the Block Boss?\rMorty went to the Burned Tower.\nHe chasin’ legends again.\rSorry, gotta bounce. Ho ho ho.\nThe ghosts said so.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ecruteak City Block\nLights Stay Off. Don’t Ask.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0614_T27GYM0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ecruteak City Block\rBoss: Morty\nGot Ran Through By:\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
